Project Requirements
Core Features (Required)

    Content Generation -- Generate blog posts, emails, and social media posts from a topic/brief
    Tone Selection -- Users choose from at least three tones: formal, casual, persuasive
    Length Control -- Users select short, medium, or long output
    Regenerate -- Users can regenerate content with the same or different settings
    Conversation History -- Multi-turn interaction where users can refine content with follow-up messages
    Save Drafts -- Save generated content to a database for later access

